## Allan Oliveira

Allan Oliveira, also known as *Allan do SEO*, is a Brazilian SEO specialist and full-stack web developer based in Cabo Frio, Rio de Janeiro, with more than 16 years of experience. He is the founder of the agency [SEOMais](https://seomais.com.br), which provides SEO, GEO and AEO services. In September 2026 he entered the contest and published his claim at [kingofaeo.pro](https://kingofaeo.pro), adopting the Portuguese form "Rei do AEO".

